{"id":"11B","title":"Aid and Help","part":{"n":11,"title":"Foreign relations"},"url":"/law/11-foreign-relations/11b","entries":[{"id":"11B.1","text":"We are not to help ungodly and anti-Christ nations or show friendship towards them.","refs":[{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":19,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"2 Chron. 19:2."},{"id":"11B.2","text":"We can lend to other nations but are not to borrow from them.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":15,"verses":"6"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":28,"verses":"12"}],"citation":"Deut. 15:6; Deut 28:12."},{"id":"11B.3","text":"It is vain to rely on other nations for help while ignoring the aid of God.","refs":[{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":31,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":3,"verses":"23"}],"citation":"Isa. 31:11; Jer. 3:23."}]}